    (J6A.aNum s t (HAx p α) (J6A.kkA (HAx p α) q)
      (J6A.jcB s t (HAx p α) (J6A.kkA (HAx p α) q) - J6A.WA p α (HAx p α) + i) : ℤ) ≤ 2 ^ W
  fA : ∀ q < ncA p t α, ∀ i < 2 * J6A.WA p α (HAx p α), |fA p s t α (HAx p α) q i| ≤ 2 ^ W
  rN : ∀ q < ncA p t α, ∀ e < 2 * J6A.WA p α (HAx p α) + 2 * HAx p α,
    (rNum p s t α (HAx p α) q e : ℤ) ≤ 2 ^ W
  fR : ∀ q < ncA p t α, ∀ e < 2 * J6A.WA p α (HAx p α) + 2 * HAx p α,
    |fR p s t α (HAx p α) q e| ≤ 2 ^ W
  cN : ∀ κ < 2 * HAx p α, cNumA s t (HAx p α) κ < 2 ^ W
  cB : ∀ κ < 2 * HAx p α, |expPos (2 * p) (t ^ 2 * α ^ 2) (cNumA s t (HAx p α) κ) (p / 2) *
      betaT (2 * p) α| < 2 ^ W
  cE : ∀ κ < 2 * HAx p α, |expPos (2 * p) (t ^ 2 * α ^ 2) (cNumA s t (HAx p α) κ) (p / 2)| <
      2 ^ W

end J6Seg.ATab

