/-!
# B-line IL, `J` pre-table (B5-J), part 11: derived expressions and their values

`fmE x y` (`fmul`), `fdE x y` (`fdiv`) with `2^P` on `9`, `2^(P+1)` on `10`; `mx0E` (`max · 0`);
`sgE` (`(-1)^h`); `bOfE` (`bOf s t l`, `s` on `22`, `t` on `23`); indicators `ltE`, `eqE`;
